{"issue": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1509", "repository_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK", "labels_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1509/labels{/name}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1509/comments", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1509/events", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1509", "id": 971005783, "node_id": "MDU6SXNzdWU5NzEwMDU3ODM=", "number": 1509, "title": "Get vehicle time since boot", "user": {"login": "danduril", "id": 77421483, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjc3NDIxNDgz", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/77421483?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/danduril", "html_url": "https://github.com/danduril", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/danduril/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/danduril/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/danduril/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/danduril/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/danduril/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/danduril/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/danduril/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/danduril/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/danduril/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "labels": [{"id": 1594597435, "node_id": "MDU6TGFiZWwxNTk0NTk3NDM1", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/labels/feature", "name": "feature", "color": "2be2be", "default": false, "description": ""}], "state": "closed", "locked": false, "assignees": [], "milestone": null, "comments": 1, "created_at": "2021-08-14T22:28:41Z", "updated_at": "2021-08-30T16:15:08Z", "closed_at": "2021-08-30T08:49:10Z", "assignee": null, "author_association": "NONE", "issue_field_values": [], "type": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "sub_issues_summary": {"total": 0, "completed": 0, "percent_completed": 0}, "issue_dependencies_summary": {"blocked_by": 0, "total_blocked_by": 0, "blocking": 0, "total_blocking": 0}, "body": "I'm writing mavsdk-based tests using `autopilot_tester` from the PX4 repo. The controls guy tests his stuff using MATLAB scripts that trigger certain inputs at certain times. My job is to replicate his tests in the integrated sitl environment. My first attempt was less than perfect because the sitl logs had a variable time scale. Next, I tried adjusting the time according to the speed-up factor. That kind of worked but still not great. Finally, I exposed `_last_time_boot_ms` via a `get_time()` method in the `info` interface, which lead to a usable solution.\r\n\r\nExample MATLAB:\r\n```\r\nif simtime_sec >= 15.0\r\n    OutputRC.RC_Thrust = 0.5;\r\nend\r\n\r\nif simtime_sec >= 20.0\r\n    OutputRC.RC_Thrust = 0.6;\r\nend\r\n\r\nif simtime_sec >= 25.0\r\n    OutputRC.RC_Thrust = 0.4;\r\nend\r\n\r\nif simtime_sec >= 30.0\r\n    OutputRC.RC_Roll = 0.1;\r\nend\r\n\r\nif simtime_sec >= 35.0\r\n    OutputRC.RC_Roll = -0.1;\r\nend\r\n\r\nif simtime_sec >= 40.0\r\n    OutputRC.RC_Roll = 0.0;\r\n    OutputRC.RC_Pitch = 0.1;\r\nend\r\n\r\nif simtime_sec >= 45.0\r\n    OutputRC.RC_Pitch = -0.1;\r\nend\r\n\r\nif simtime_sec >= 50.0\r\n    OutputRC.RC_Yaw = 0.2;\r\n    OutputRC.RC_Pitch = 0.0;\r\nend\r\n\r\nif simtime_sec >= 55.0\r\n    OutputRC.RC_Yaw = -0.2;\r\nend\r\n\r\nif simtime_sec >= 60.0\r\n    OutputRC.RC_Yaw = 0.0;\r\nend\r\n```\r\nC++ replica (`get_time()` is a local wrapper around a new `_info->get_time()` method I added):\r\n```\r\n\tconst auto start_time = get_time();\r\n\tdo {\r\n\t\tCHECK(_manual_control->set_manual_control_input(0.0F, 0.0F, 0.5F, 0.0F)\r\n\t\t      == ManualControl::Result::Success);\r\n\t\tsleep_for(manual_control_update_period);\r\n\t} while (get_time() - start_time < seconds(20));\r\n\r\n\tdo {\r\n\t\tCHECK(_manual_control->set_manual_control_input(0.0F, 0.0F, 0.6F, 0.0F)\r\n\t\t      == ManualControl::Result::Success);\r\n\t\tsleep_for(manual_control_update_period);\r\n\t} while (get_time() - start_time < seconds(25));\r\n\r\n\tdo {\r\n\t\tCHECK(_manual_control->set_manual_control_input(0.0F, 0.0F, 0.4F, 0.0F)\r\n\t\t      == ManualControl::Result::Success);\r\n\t\tsleep_for(manual_control_update_period);\r\n\t} while (get_time() - start_time < seconds(30));\r\n\r\n\tdo {\r\n\t\tCHECK(_manual_control->set_manual_control_input(0.0F, 0.1F, 0.4F, 0.0F)\r\n\t\t      == ManualControl::Result::Success);\r\n\t\tsleep_for(manual_control_update_period);\r\n\t} while (get_time() - start_time < seconds(35));\r\n\r\n\tdo {\r\n\t\tCHECK(_manual_control->set_manual_control_input(0.0F, -0.1F, 0.4F, 0.0F)\r\n\t\t      == ManualControl::Result::Success);\r\n\t\tsleep_for(manual_control_update_period);\r\n\t} while (get_time() - start_time < seconds(40));\r\n\r\n\tdo {\r\n\t\tCHECK(_manual_control->set_manual_control_input(-0.1F, 0.0F, 0.4F, 0.0F)\r\n\t\t      == ManualControl::Result::Success);\r\n\t\tsleep_for(manual_control_update_period);\r\n\t} while (get_time() - start_time < seconds(45));\r\n\r\n\tdo {\r\n\t\tCHECK(_manual_control->set_manual_control_input(0.1F, 0.0F, 0.4F, 0.0F)\r\n\t\t      == ManualControl::Result::Success);\r\n\t\tsleep_for(manual_control_update_period);\r\n\t} while (get_time() - start_time < seconds(50));\r\n\r\n\tdo {\r\n\t\tCHECK(_manual_control->set_manual_control_input(0.0F, 0.0F, 0.4F, 0.2F)\r\n\t\t      == ManualControl::Result::Success);\r\n\t\tsleep_for(manual_control_update_period);\r\n\t} while (get_time() - start_time < seconds(55));\r\n\r\n\tdo {\r\n\t\tCHECK(_manual_control->set_manual_control_input(0.0F, 0.0F, 0.4F, -0.2F)\r\n\t\t      == ManualControl::Result::Success);\r\n\t\tsleep_for(manual_control_update_period);\r\n\t} while (get_time() - start_time < seconds(60));\r\n\r\n\tdo {\r\n\t\tCHECK(_manual_control->set_manual_control_input(0.0F, 0.0F, 0.4F, 0.0F)\r\n\t\t      == ManualControl::Result::Success);\r\n\t\tsleep_for(manual_control_update_period);\r\n\t} while (get_time() - start_time < seconds(70));\r\n```\r\n", "closed_by": {"login": "julianoes", "id": 1419688, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk2ODg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1419688?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes", "html_url": "https://github.com/julianoes", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1509/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "timeline_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1509/timeline", "performed_via_github_app": null, "state_reason": "completed", "pinned_comment": null}, "comments": [{"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/908477295", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1509#issuecomment-908477295", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1509", "id": 908477295, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s42JkNv", "user": {"login": "dgeorge83616", "id": 434667, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjQzNDY2Nw==", "avatar_url": "https://avatars